  "translation": "Na Mose i tok long Khabab, pikinini bilong Reuel, man bilong Midian, tambu bilong Mose: Mipela i go long ples we Yahwe i tok: Mi bai givim ⟨את⟩ en long yu. Yu kam wantaim ⟨את⟩ mipela, na mipela bai mekim gutpela samting long yu, bilong wanem, Yahwe i tokim gutpela tok long Yisrael.",
